{"3699950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GO! GO! Beetle Roller!", "steam_appid": 3699950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3755290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The devious Androliens have trapped the beloved superhero Beetle Roller inside a digital world, and it's up to you to help him escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race to the goal</strong> of each stage while <strong>posing fabulously!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/8d012f04e19a049441ea5af7d089b2aa.poster.avif?t=1777348298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/8d012f04e19a049441ea5af7d089b2aa.webm?t=1777348298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect colorful orbs</strong> to grow your Beetle Ball gadget! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/3920ed28e9c65aca2016105a3de209ed.poster.avif?t=1777348298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/3920ed28e9c65aca2016105a3de209ed.webm?t=1777348298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And use your ball's power to <strong>squash your foes!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/35c82beb09164c27577dd1e28ab48c5d.poster.avif?t=1777348298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/35c82beb09164c27577dd1e28ab48c5d.webm?t=1777348298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BREAKDOWN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay inspired by a mashup of <i>Katamari</i>, <i>Monkey Ball</i>,<i> </i>and <i>Pizza Tower</i> with a <i>Kamen Rider</i> inspired protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant and explosive art style inspired by anime and PS2 era games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 blood-pumping levels with 3 different aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 time ranks to collect in each level - can you get the fastest time? Prepare yourself for BEETLE ROLLER'S FINAL JUDGEMENT...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUR STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO! GO! Beetle Roller! was developed as a four-person student project at Eastern Michigan University. The game was created from scratch within a ~10 week period.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The devious Androliens have trapped the beloved superhero Beetle Roller inside a digital world, and it's up to you to help him escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race to the goal</strong> of each stage while <strong>posing fabulously!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/8d012f04e19a049441ea5af7d089b2aa.poster.avif?t=1777348298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/8d012f04e19a049441ea5af7d089b2aa.webm?t=1777348298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect colorful orbs</strong> to grow your Beetle Ball gadget! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/3920ed28e9c65aca2016105a3de209ed.poster.avif?t=1777348298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/3920ed28e9c65aca2016105a3de209ed.webm?t=1777348298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And use your ball's power to <strong>squash your foes!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/35c82beb09164c27577dd1e28ab48c5d.poster.avif?t=1777348298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/35c82beb09164c27577dd1e28ab48c5d.webm?t=1777348298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BREAKDOWN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay inspired by a mashup of <i>Katamari</i>, <i>Monkey Ball</i>,<i> </i>and <i>Pizza Tower</i> with a <i>Kamen Rider</i> inspired protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant and explosive art style inspired by anime and PS2 era games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 blood-pumping levels with 3 different aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 time ranks to collect in each level - can you get the fastest time? Prepare yourself for BEETLE ROLLER'S FINAL JUDGEMENT...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUR STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO! GO! Beetle Roller! was developed as a four-person student project at Eastern Michigan University. The game was created from scratch within a ~10 week period.</p>", "short_description": "The 3D Action Platformer starring the titular superhero BEETLE ROLLER! Collect orbs to grow your ball gadget, blast through walls, and squish foes unworthy of your power in a mad dash to reach the end of each level!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/de3a4302c99e666d56a8d1ee42f4162fe22697d7/header.jpg?t=1777348298", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/6782f622cc2a91a68e5e64583bd16ede16501be9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777348298", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/6782f622cc2a91a68e5e64583bd16ede16501be9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777348298", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["cocoteam"], "publishers": ["cocoteam"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "